        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy VEED Remove Video Background- Matte Export\n\nCut the subject out of a video with VEED Remove Video Background: the node segments the foreground in every frame and returns the frames plus an alpha mask, and Join Image with Alpha turns that mask into a transparent PNG sequence ready to composite. Choose standard, fast or green-screen keying; clips up to 60 seconds. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_veed_remove_video_background.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
